      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9692591::web::026::4_conclusions",
        "PMC9787501::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-based oxide scale of the untreated alloy is less protective than the proposed continuous alumina scale.",
